hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3","It is narrated from Yusuf bin Abdullah bin Salam, he said: Whenever the Prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him) sat and talked, he would frequently raise his gaze towards the sky."
"4","It is narrated from Hazrat Abdullah bin Salam (may Allah be pleased with him) that whenever the Prophet (peace be upon him) spoke, and then narrated as in the previous hadith."
